# The Linux CI runner executes gradlew directly. If Git ever handed it CRLF line
# endings the shebang would break with "bad interpreter" and every build would
# fail before it started — so pin it, and the wrapper it reads, to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.png binary
